{
  "opening": [
	{
	  "char": "",
	  "text": "Once upon a time at the peaceful mountain peak. A family of stones rests beneath the warm morning sun.",
	  "time": 4.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "Rocky",
	  "text": "From up here... the whole world looks so [b]small[/b], Son.",
	  "time": 3.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Stonya",
	  "text": "One day, you'll become a strong stone, just like us.",
	  "time": 3.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "[wave amp=20 freq=5]I want to see the whole world![/wave]",
	  "time": 2.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "Rocky",
	  "text": "Haha, maybe someday.",
	  "time": 2.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Stonya",
	  "text": "Okay Honey, playing time is over, lets go home and have lunch.",
	  "time": 3.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "[shake rate=15 level=5]Nooo! I don’t wanna go home yet![/shake]",
	  "time": 2.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "There’s still so much of the world I haven’t seen!",
	  "time": 3.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Rocky",
	  "text": "One day, you will. But adventure can wait.",
	  "time": 3.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Stonya",
	  "text": "Pebble, the world is [b]not that safe[/b] for a stone like us.",
	  "time": 3.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "Is that so?",
	  "time": 1.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "",
	  "text": "A giant shadow sweeps across the mountain.",
	  "time": 3.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Stonya",
	  "text": "...",
	  "time": 1.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Rocky",
	  "text": "[font_size=28][shake rate=30 level=15]GET DOWN![/shake][/font_size]",
	  "time": 1.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "",
	  "text": "A massive eagle swoops in and snatches Little Pebble.",
	  "time": 3.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "[font_size=26][shake rate=25 level=12]MOM!! DAD!![/shake][/font_size]",
	  "time": 2.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "",
	  "text": "The eagle flies higher and higher.",
	  "time": 3.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "[shake rate=20 level=10]Let me go![/shake]",
	  "time": 1.5
	},
	{
	  "text": "[font_size=26][shake rate=25 level=12]LET ME GO![/shake][/font_size]",
	  "time": 2.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "",
	  "text": "He struggles with all his strength. The eagle loses its grip. And... Little Pebble falls.",
	  "time": 5.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "[font_size=30][shake rate=30 level=20]AAAAAAAHHHH!![/shake][/font_size]",
	  "time": 2.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "[shake rate=15 level=8]I'm too young to become gravel![/shake]",
	  "time": 2.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "",
	  "text": "Seconds before hitting the ground...",
	  "time": 2.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Froggy",
	  "text": "[wave]Slurp[/wave], Time to eat some flies!",
	  "time": 2.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "",
	  "text": "A frog accidentally catches him with its tongue.",
	  "time": 3.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Froggy",
	  "text": "...",
	  "time": 1.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Froggy",
	  "text": "[b]Gulp[/b]",
	  "time": 1.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Froggy",
	  "text": "[shake rate=10 level=5]Blegh.[/shake]",
	  "time": 1.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "",
	  "text": "The pebble is spat back out.",
	  "time": 2.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Froggy",
	  "text": "Thought you were a flies.",
	  "time": 2.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "[wave]Owww[/wave], what a life...",
	  "time": 2.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "This is definitely not how I imagined my first adventure.",
	  "time": 3.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "Froggy",
	  "text": "Umm hello, where you came from? Sky?",
	  "time": 3.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "I should be at the mountain peak, but because of that eagle, here I am, And I almost became frog food.",
	  "time": 5.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Froggy",
	  "text": "Oh you're coming from that peak up there, huh?",
	  "time": 3.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "[b]I need to go up as soon as possible![/b]",
	  "time": 2.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "",
	  "text": "Pebble tried to climb, but he couldn't.",
	  "time": 2.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "Pebble",
	  "text": "[shake rate=5 level=3]Oh No... I can't go back.[/shake]",
	  "time": 2.5
	},
	{
	  "char": "Froggy",
	  "text": "Of course u can't. Here, I'll teach you how to be a [b]real stone[/b].",
	  "time": 4.0
	},
	{
	  "char": "",
	  "text": "Years passed. The little pebble never seen his home again for a long time. But he did find... a way.",
	  "time": 5.5
	}
  ],
